nd ask about peer learning support; the center also documents free printing and snacks there.","short_summary":"Academic Success Center space with undergraduate study support.","evidence_claim":"UT Knoxville states that the Vol Study Center offers free resources for all undergraduate students, including study space, free printing, and snacks at Strong Hall room 102.","source_url":"https://studentsuccess.utk.edu/academicsuccess/vol-study-center/","source_title":"Vol Study Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The page identifies Strong Hall room 102 as the main location and advises confirming availability because occasional closures can occur.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"utk-devine-study-tables","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Study Tables at DeVine Music Library","title":"Study Tables at DeVine Music Library","subtitle":"DeVine Music Library · Natalie L. Haslam Music Center, G04","notes":"Choose the music library tables for a change of setting while working with music resources; the library’s current spaces listing identifies them as study tables.","short_summary":"Study tables inside UT’s George F. DeVine Music Library.","evidence_claim":"UT Libraries’ current spaces listing includes Study Tables at DeVine Music Library as a study space.","source_url":"https://old.lib.utk.edu/hours/spaces/","source_title":"Spaces - Hours","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"DeVine Music Library is located in room G04 of the Natalie L. Haslam Music Center; consult the library listing for current availability.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"utk-sixth-floor-study-lounge","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Study Lounge - Sixth Floor","title":"Study Lounge